.TH "PERCH-VERSION" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-version \- print the version
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch version [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Print the version embedded at build time, or the module version for go install builds.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch version
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1)
